{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p> </p>\n<p>此次地面停飛影響了數萬架次航班，暫停起飛航班超過四小時。這是自9·11以來美國航班起飛中斷時間最長的一次。</p>\n<p>交通部長肖恩·達菲周日表示，作為L3Harris Technologies所監管系統升級的一部分，在阿肯色州南部安裝的一個過載路由器似乎壓垮了為空中交通管制提供雷達和其他數據的系統。</p>\n<p> <img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/tech/transform/59/w550h309/20261118/1cd3-86afec18393f92fe178d1ec99b915d65.png\"/></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T21:41:14.630704+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T20:56:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T22:46:36.889345+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T21:34:25.491083+00:00","content_hash":"52fc1dedc050706c3e16dff97c3a43fdeecca06f5a6a5b6deb36c134778fae9d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T21:41:14.630704+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}